async" data-nimg="1" class="h-auto" style="color:transparent" src="/zse_logo_white.png"/></div><p class="text-white text-sm leading-relaxed mb-6">Zimbabwe Stock Exchange – Providing a transparent, efficient marketplace for securities trading within Zimbabwe’s regulated financial market.</p><ul class="space-y-4 pt-4 border-t border-white/5"><li><a class="text-white hover:text-[#00AEEF] text-sm border-b border-white/10 pb-1 inline-block transition-colors" href="/terms-of-service">Terms of Service</a></li><li><a class="text-white hover:text-[#00AEEF] text-sm border-b border-white/10 pb-1 inline-block transition-colors" href="/privacy-policy">Privacy Policy</a></li><li><a class="text-white hover:text-[#00AEEF] text-sm border-b border-white/10 pb-1 inline-block transition-colors" href="/about-us/contact-us">Contact ZSE</a></li></ul></div></div><div><h3 class="font-bold text-lg mb-4 text-white">Information</h3><ul class="space-y-4"><li><a class="text-white hover:text-[#00AEEF] text-sm border-b border-white/10 pb-1 inline-block transition-colors" href="/regulation/rules-regulations">ZSE Rules and Regulation</a></li><li><a class="text-white hover:text-[#00AEEF] text-sm border-b border-white/10 pb-1 inline-block transition-colors" href="/listed-securities/equity">Listed Companies</a></li><li><a class="text-white hover:text-[#00AEEF] text-sm border-b border-white/10 pb-1 inline-block transition-colors" href="/regulation/general-faqs">Guide to Listings</a></li><li><a class="text-white hover:text-[#00AEEF] text-sm border-b border-white/10 pb-1 inline-block transition-colors" href="/members/stockbrokers">Licenced Stock Brokers</a></li><li><a class="text-white hover:text-[#00AEEF] text-sm border-b border-white/10 pb-1 inline-block transition-colors" href="/docs?exchange=ZSE&amp;category=listings guide">Listings Guide</a></li><li><a class="text-white hover:text-[#00AEEF] text-sm border-b border-white/10 pb-1 inline-block transition-colors" href="/docs?exchange=ZSE&amp;category=investment guide">Investment Guide</a></li></ul></div><div><h3 class="font-bold text-lg mb-4 text-white">Other Links</h3><ul class="space-y-4"><li><a href="https://zimtreasury.co.zw/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-white hover:text-[#00AEEF] text-sm border-b border-white/10 pb-1 inline-block transition-colors">Ministry of Finance, Economic Development and Investment Promotion (MoFEDIP)</a></li><li><a href="https://seczim.co.zw/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-white hover:text-[#00AEEF] text-sm border-b border-white/10 pb-1 inline-block transition-colors">Securities and Exchange Commission of Zimbabwe (SECZim)</a></li><li><a href="https://www.rbz.co.zw/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-white hover:text-[#00AEEF] text-sm border-b border-white/10 pb-1 inline-block transition-colors">Reserve Bank of Zimbabwe (RBZ)</a></li><li><a href="https://www.chengetedzai.co.zw/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-white hover:text-[#00AEEF] text-sm border-b border-white/10 pb-1 inline-block transition-colors">Chengetedzai Depository Company (CDC)</a></li></ul></div><div><h3 class="font-bold text-lg mb-4 text-white">Trading Hours</h3><div class="space-y-4"><p class="text-xs text-white/50 leading-tight">Monday to Friday, excluding public holidays.</p><div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-3"><div class="flex justify-between items-center border-b border-white/5 pb-1"><span class="text-[10px] text-white/40 uppercase font-bold tracking-wider">Pre-Open</span><span class="text-xs font-semibold text-white">09:00 - 09:30</span></div><div class="flex justify-between items-center border-b border-white/5 pb-1"><span class="text-[10px] text-[#00ADEE] uppercase font-bold tracking-wider">Market Open</span><span class="text-xs font-semibold text-white">09:30 - 13:00</span></div><div class="flex justify-between items-center border-b border-white/5 pb-1"><span class="text-[10px] text-white/40 uppercase font-bold tracking-wi